/* 4-way interleaved AVX2 SHA-256, scalar message schedule, vector state.
   Processes 4 independent 64-byte blocks at a time (not standard streaming).
   For a microbench we hash the same buffer as 4 independent streams by
   striding... actually for fair compare we just time the kernel on N/4 groups
   of 4 consecutive blocks, which is NOT a correct single-stream SHA-256 but
   measures achievable throughput of the compression function. */
